  "details": "Description\n\nif you open the text box with y while you are scrolling the third person camera out you will inadvertently cause the text box to shrink \n\ndepending on how fast you are scrolling you will get different distances and subsequent shrinking \n\nReproduction Steps\n\n1. be in the middle of scrolling out the camera \n\n2. press Y at the same time  \n\nResult should be a shrink determined by how far the camera moved\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1915-75b77d9555-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-21_21-50-53.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_a7a7454d-9068-4482-a8f4-8cdebb2e9eae/1/file)",
